The reason why Clay is having you look
for Team Plasma is 'cause he is testing{VAR BE00}
your abilities.

Cheren: {VAR 0100 0000}...{VAR BE01}
Do you think Team Plasma could be
in there?{VAR BE01}
I don't like cold places, but we have
to check. What a bother.

You can get to the Cold Storage through
the gap between the fence and the{VAR BE00}
container over there.

For a few loads, send it by Pokémon.
For a lot of loads, send it by ship.{VAR BE01}
Use the best method for your needs!

A helmet is an important tool for
shock protection!{VAR BE01}
It's good to let your Pokémon
have one, too!{VAR BE01}

If you let a Pokémon hold a Rocky Helmet,
the foe will also be damaged if that foe's{VAR BE00}
move makes physical contact.
